{title: Praise Him Praise Him}
{key: F}

{comment: Chorus 1}
[F]Praise Him, [F]Praise Him[F7]
[Bb]Praise Him in the [Gm/Bb]morn  -   [Bb]ing,
[Gm7]Praise Him in the noon [F]time
[F]Praise Him, [F/D]Praise Him[Gm7]
[F/C]Praise Him when the [Am/C]sun      [C7]goes  [F]down.

{comment: Chorus 2}
[F]Love Him, [F]Love Him,[F7]
[Bb]Love Him in the [Gm/Bb]morn  -   [Bb]ing,
[Gm7]Love Him in the noon [F]time
[F]Love Him, [F/D]Love Him,[Gm7]
[F/C]Love Him when the [Am/C]sun      [C7]goes  [F]down.[Bb/F][F]
